                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Loved it but never should have been abandoned. I had it on PSVR and now Steam VR. I really wish as a dev myself this game was not forgotten especially with Very Positive reviews. So much potential to bring to players but instead simply thrown away. I want to tell people about the game but with no content other then the basic burger stuff it is just repetitive after a hour and is just not worth it anymore. What a shame. I really thought from the years between when I got it on PlayStation and now the dev would have added something fresh but I was wrong.",
